Subject: [PATCH 08/22] tools: convert SenseNova-Loop-9B BF16 to the engine's
 MLX affine format

A numpy writer of the engine's MLX affine codes (u32 words, bf16 scales and
biases), with the checkpoint's zero-centred norms folded to 1 + w, the gated
linear_attn.norm left as stored, conv1d as [qkv, kernel, 1] and the vision
tower left out. Taken unchanged from the Metal series so both backends load
the same converted tree.
